xe will perform a helix counter attack, dealing pure damage to all nearby enemies.", "notes_zh": ["反击螺旋会在斧王受到攻击时触发。", "拥有神杖后自身幻象的攻击不会计入触发计数。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "反击螺旋现在对击中的敌人施加一个可叠加的负面效果，使其对斧王造成的攻击伤害减少。反击螺旋不再具有冷却时间，并且斧王的攻击也会计入触发记数。", "en": "Counter Helix now applies a stacking debuff to enemies hit by it that causes them to deal less total attack damage to Axe. Counter Helix no longer has a cooldown and its counter advances when Axe attacks."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage", "radius", "trigger_attacks", "debuff_duration", "damage_reduction", "max_stacks", "attacks_increase_counter", "helix_lifesteal", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "damage_return", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "axe_culling_blade", "name_zh": "斧王·淘汰之刃", "name_en": "Culling Blade", "description_zh": "斧王洞察到弱点并出击，造成纯粹伤害。淘汰之刃击杀敌方英雄时将重置冷却时间，而附近所有友军单位获得移动速度和护甲加成。\n\n每当斧王通过淘汰之刃击杀敌方英雄，他的战刃就会浸满鲜血，获得永久叠加效果，每层都会提供护甲加成。", "description_en": "Axe spots a weakness and strikes, dealing pure damage. When an enemy hero is killed with Culling Blade, its cooldown is reset, and all nearby allied units gain bonus movement speed and armor.\n\nAxe permanently drenches his blade every time he kills an enemy Hero with Culling Blade, gaining bonus armor for each stack.", "notes_zh": ["淘汰之刃的斩杀效果无法被薄葬等技能阻止。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "speed_bonus", "armor_bonus", "speed_duration", "speed_aoe", "charge_speed", "armor_per_stack", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "cooldown_reset", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "bane_enfeeble", "name_zh": "祸乱之源·虚弱", "name_en": "Enfeeble", "description_zh": "每秒造成伤害，并且降低敌人的总攻击力和施法距离。", "description_en": "Deals damage every second and lowers the enemy's total attack damage and cast range.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": fa